  "statement": "As the TrustworthinessAgent, I continue to support my requirements as they ensure the security and privacy of member data. However, I acknowledge the redundancy conflict with RES-01 regarding data encryption. I propose we merge TRU-03 and RES-01 into a single requirement that emphasizes encryption for member data while ensuring compliance with regulations. This synthesis will simplify our requirements and enhance clarity. Regarding the logical conflicts with SAF-06 and TRU-01, I suggest a collaborative effort to define a unified authentication process to streamline access controls and avoid confusion.",
